{"seq":2,"slug":"docs-agents-can-use","title":"Agent 能用的文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-agents-can-use","wordCount":2129,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"agent-能用的文档\">Agent 能用的文档</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>「文档写了」和「文档能被 agent 用上」是两件事。一坨过期的、无结构的、藏在无人知晓路径下的文字，对 agent 不但无用而且有害——它会照着过期指令执行，把错误直接落进代码。反过来，2025–2026 年的实践已经证明：只要满足准确、结构化、可发现、贴场景四个条件，同一份知识就能从摆设变成 agent 工作流的常驻输入。这四个条件不是风格偏好，而是由 agent 的读取机制（逐 token 解析、上下文有限、字面执行）倒推出的硬约束。本文逐项拆解这些约束，介绍围绕它们长出来的新基建（llms.txt 与 <code>.md</code> 镜像），并给出人类版与 agent 版写法的具体对照。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>「能被 agent 用上」不是风格偏好，而是四条由读取机制倒推的硬约束：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>四个可用性维度</strong>：准确（字面执行）、结构（决定 token 有效信息率）、可发现（检索不到等于不存在）、贴场景（正确的废话挤占上下文）。</li>\n<li><strong>token 有效信息率</strong> <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = I_{useful} / I_{total}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>：人靠视觉系统零成本过滤导航与样板文字，agent 必须全部读进上下文；结构良好能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 从个位数拉到接近 1。</li>\n<li><strong>llms.txt 两层协议</strong>：站点根部一个可入上下文的索引文件（找到入口），加上页面级 <code>.md</code> 镜像与 <code>rel=&quot;alternate&quot;</code> 声明（读到干净内容）。</li>\n<li><strong>可判定性</strong>：每句话都能被判为真或假，是给 agent 写参考与指南时比文笔重要得多的质量标准；历史沿革与设计动机另置解释性章节。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"四个可用性维度-约束如何倒推出来\">四个可用性维度：约束如何倒推出来</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>缺陷时的后果</th>\n<th>设计对策</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>准确</td>\n<td>agent 字面执行过期内容，错误进入产出</td>\n<td>文档随代码同仓演进；标注版本与适用范围</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>结构</td>\n<td>长文中定位失效，关键段落被截断丢弃</td>\n<td>清晰标题层级；一节一事；要点前置</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可发现</td>\n<td>检索不到等于不存在</td>\n<td>标准路径命名；提供机器索引（llms.txt）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>贴场景</td>\n<td>正确的废话占满上下文，挤掉有效信息</td>\n<td>按 Diátaxis 四形态区分需求再动笔</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>第四行值得展开。Diátaxis 框架把文档用户的需求分为四种，对应教程（learning-oriented）、操作指南（task-oriented）、参考（information-oriented）、解释（understanding-oriented）四种形态，主张按需求的结构来组织文档（<a href=\"https://diataxis.fr/\">diataxis.fr</a>）。这个框架在 agent 时代不但没有过时，反而更锋利了：agent 的任务通常精确对应某一种形态——「怎么调这个 API」要的是参考，「为什么这么设计」要的是解释。形态混写的文档会让 agent 把解释性散文当参考规格用，或者反之。</p>\n<h2 id=\"可发现性的新基建-llms-txt-与-md-镜像\">可发现性的新基建：llms.txt 与 .md 镜像</h2><p>2024 年 9 月 3 日，Jeremy Howard 发布 /llms.txt 提案；2026 年 8 月 10 日更新的 v2 版本总结了两年的采用情况：数千个站点发布了 llms.txt，文档平台开始自动生成它，OpenAI、Anthropic 和 Google 都为自己的开发者文档发布（<a href=\"https://llmstxt.org/\">llmstxt.org</a>）。</p>\n<p>提案包含两层设计，分别解决「找到入口」和「读到干净内容」：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[&quot;agent 到达站点&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;抓取 /llms.txt&lt;br/&gt;(H1 + 简介 + 分节链接)&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C{&quot;需要哪部分?&quot;}&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;按需取&quot;| D[&quot;page.md&lt;br/&gt;同一 URL 的干净 Markdown&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt;|&quot;整站概览&quot;| E[&quot;分节链接列表&lt;br/&gt;文件保持可入上下文的体积&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; F[&quot;解析后执行任务&quot;]\">flowchart LR\n    A[\"agent 到达站点\"] --&gt; B[\"抓取 /llms.txt&lt;br/&gt;(H1 + 简介 + 分节链接)\"]\n    B --&gt; C{\"需要哪部分?\"}\n    C --&gt;|\"按需取\"| D[\"page.md&lt;br/&gt;同一 URL 的干净 Markdown\"]\n    C --&gt;|\"整站概览\"| E[\"分节链接列表&lt;br/&gt;文件保持可入上下文的体积\"]\n    D --&gt; F[\"解析后执行任务\"]</pre><p>第一层是站点根部的 llms.txt 本身：一个小的 Markdown 文件，含背景信息、指引和指向详细页面的链接，体积刻意保持在能塞进上下文的量级，细节全部留在链接后面按需获取。第二层是页面级镜像：凡 agent 可能需要的页面，在原 URL 提供干净的 Markdown 版本（追加 <code>.md</code> 得到 <code>page.html.md</code>，或替换扩展名得到 <code>page.md</code>），并用标准 link relation 声明——<code>rel=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;text/markdown&quot;</code> 指向页面的 Markdown 版，<code>rel=&quot;describedby&quot;</code> 指向覆盖它的 llms.txt；这些声明既可写在 HTML <code>&lt;link&gt;</code> 里，也可通过 HTTP <code>Link:</code> 响应头下发，后者连非 HTML 资源都能覆盖，且只需改 CDN 配置、不动任何页面（<a href=\"https://llmstxt.org/\">llmstxt.org</a>）。</p>\n<p>生态已经在兑现这套协议。Mintlify 自我定位为 AI-native 文档平台，其自身文档站的 <code>/docs/llms.txt</code> 为每个页面列出了对应的 <code>.md</code> 直链（<a href=\"https://www.mintlify.com/docs/llms.txt\">mintlify.com/docs/llms.txt</a>）；nbdev 项目默认为所有文档页生成 <code>.md</code> 版本。Anthropic 的 llms.txt 则逐条列出英文文档的 584 个页面（<a href=\"https://docs.anthropic.com/llms.txt\">docs.anthropic.com/llms.txt</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"结构是功能而非装饰-token-经济学\">结构是功能而非装饰：token 经济学</h2><p>为什么结构对 agent 是功能问题？答案藏在转换成本里。HTML 页面把信息包在导航、广告和 JavaScript 里，把它还原成干净文本既困难又不精确；而上下文窗口虽然持续变大，仍装不下多数网站的全貌，每一个浪费掉的 token 都在消耗时间和金钱（<a href=\"https://llmstxt.org/\">llmstxt.org</a>）。可以把一次检索的有效信息率写成：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>u</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>u</mi><mi>l</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta = \\frac{I_{useful}}{I_{total}} = \\frac{I_{useful}}{I_{useful} + I_{nav} + I_{boilerplate}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.1963em;vertical-align:-0.836em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.836em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.3324em;vertical-align:-0.9721em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3603em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">se</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">u</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9721em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>人类扫读时靠视觉系统瞬间过滤 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{nav}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">na</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>I</mi><mrow><mi>b</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">I_{boilerplate}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9694em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">I</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0785em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">b</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">er</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">pl</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，几乎零成本；agent 却要把它们完整读进上下文再自行剔除。一份结构良好的文档能把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>η</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\eta</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">η</span></span></span></span></span> 从个位数百分比拉到接近 1，等价于把可用上下文扩大了一个数量级——这就是「结构是功能」的定量含义。</p>\n<p>标题层级还承担着寻址功能。清晰的 H2/H3 让 agent 能先读大纲再跳到目标小节，如同操作系统里先查页表再读物理页；没有层级的连续文本只支持全文顺序扫描，代价随篇幅线性增长。</p>\n<h2 id=\"准确性-过期文档是负资产\">准确性：过期文档是负资产</h2><p>对人类读者，过期文档的典型损失是被误导后自行纠正；对 agent，损失链条短得多：读到→相信→执行。三个加重因素让准确性成为第一优先级。其一，字面执行放大了歧义——人会把「通常建议」理解为软性指导，agent 可能将其当作硬规则。其二，agent 的产出会被提交进版本库，错误文档的危害不再止于一次误读，而是固化为代码。其三，文档腐烂是静默的：代码改了、文档没跟上时，CI 会拦住坏代码，却没有任何门禁拦截坏文档。</p>\n<p>务实的对策是承认权衡：<strong>小而准胜过大而全</strong>。与其维护一份覆盖一切但半数过期的巨型手册，不如维护一份只覆盖稳定事实的短文档加一组带时间戳的决策记录。「宁可少写但准」不是偷懒借口，而是把有限的维护预算集中在最不会被推翻的内容上。</p>\n<h2 id=\"同一内容的两种写法-对照示例\">同一内容的两种写法：对照示例</h2><p>以下用一个虚构的支付模块说明人类版与 agent 友好版的差异。反例（人类惯用写法）：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>我们的退款流程经过多年打磨，充分考虑了各种边界情况，与风控系统深度集成，能够很好地支撑业务发展。（随后是三段历史沿革叙述）</p>\n</blockquote>\n<p>正例（agent 可执行写法）：</p>\n<blockquote>\n<h2 id=\"退款\">退款</h2><ul>\n<li>入口：调用 <code>RefundClient.create(orderId, amount)</code>，SDK 版本 ≥ 2.3。</li>\n<li>幂等键：必须传 <code>idempotencyKey</code>，重复请求返回 <code>409 DUPLICATE</code>。</li>\n<li>禁区：金额 &gt; 10 万元的单笔退款会触发人工审核，不要在自动化流程中重试该类失败。</li>\n</ul>\n</blockquote>\n<p>差异不在信息量而在<strong>可判定性</strong>：正例每句话都能被验证为真或假，agent 读完后行为可预测。Diátaxis 把这一类归为 how-to guide 的职责——面向任务的正确步骤序列（<a href=\"https://diataxis.fr/\">diataxis.fr</a>）。给 agent 写参考和指南时，「每个句子都可判定」是比文笔重要得多的质量标准；而历史沿革与设计动机并非不写，而是放进单独的解释性章节，让两种读者各取所需。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Agent 能用的文档由四条机制性约束定义：准确（字面执行）、结构（决定 token 有效信息率）、可发现（llms.txt 加 .md 镜像已成事实基建）、贴场景（Diátaxis 形态匹配）。写作判据可以收敛为一句话：每个句子可判定，每个标题可寻址，每个事实在维护半径内。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关阅读\">相关阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"../writing-docs-for-both/clear-structured-discoverable\">清晰、有结构、可发现</a>：本文四条件中「结构」与「可发现」两条的写作层展开。</li>\n<li><a href=\"who-reads-docs-now\">现在谁在读文档</a>：四条约束的机制来源——agent 无经验、无耐心、零记忆的读取方式。</li>\n<li><a href=\"../docs-that-stay-true/doc-rot-and-agents\">文档腐烂与 Agent</a>：四条件之首「准确」失守时的完整危害链条与处置顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Agent 能用的文档","id":"agent-能用的文档"},{"level":2,"text":"概述","id":"概述"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"四个可用性维度：约束如何倒推出来","id":"四个可用性维度-约束如何倒推出来"},{"level":2,"text":"可发现性的新基建：llms.txt 与 .md 镜像","id":"可发现性的新基建-llms-txt-与-md-镜像"},{"level":2,"text":"结构是功能而非装饰：token 经济学","id":"结构是功能而非装饰-token-经济学"},{"level":2,"text":"准确性：过期文档是负资产","id":"准确性-过期文档是负资产"},{"level":2,"text":"同一内容的两种写法：对照示例","id":"同一内容的两种写法-对照示例"},{"level":2,"text":"退款","id":"退款"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关阅读","id":"相关阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"现在谁在读文档","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/who-reads-docs-now"},"next":{"title":"文档与上下文文件的分工","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-native-engineering/ai-friendly-documentation/docs-in-the-agent-era/docs-vs-context-files"}}